    "Interpretation: the fractions in 4.8 refer to full planning envelopes including growth. The lab envelope is /21; the initially configured subnet is /22 (4.9\u20134.10).",
    "Draw.io correction: Building 1 student growth is 10.16.32.0/21. The illustration\u2019s 10.18.0.0/21 is outside the student pool. Missing building and lab blocks are restored from the PDF.",
